# Layout

**File:** `src/yasched/coring/Layout.py`

Visual style applied to a topic, event, or task. All sub-classes (`BackgroundStyle`,
`BorderStyle`, `IconStyle`) live in the same file because they have no independent
identity outside of a `Layout`.

A `Layout` may be defined inline or referenced by id. The `layout` field on
`Topic`, `Event`, and `Task` is typed `Layout | str | None`:
- `str` — unresolved reference to a named layout id; resolved by `backending`.
- `Layout` — inline definition.
- `None` — no layout override; inherit from parent/topic.

---

## BackgroundStyle

Background fill of the element.

### Fields

| Field    | Type                   | Description                                      |
|----------|------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `type`   | `str`                  | `"solid"` or `"gradient"`                        |
| `color`  | `Color \| None`        | Single color (used when `type` is `"solid"`)     |
| `colors` | `list[Color] \| None`  | Color stops (used when `type` is `"gradient"`)   |

### Interface

```
BackgroundStyle
  + type: str
  + color: Color | None
  + colors: list[Color] | None
```

### Notes

- Frozen dataclass.
- No cross-field validation at this layer; `backending` enforces that `"solid"`
  has `color` and `"gradient"` has `colors`.

---

## BorderStyle

Border drawn around the element.

### Fields

| Field   | Type    | Description                            |
|---------|---------|----------------------------------------|
| `type`  | `str`   | `"solid"` (only value defined so far)  |
| `width` | `str`   | CSS-style width string, e.g. `"2px"`   |
| `color` | `Color` | Border color                           |

### Interface

```
BorderStyle
  + type: str
  + width: str
  + color: Color
```

### Notes

- Frozen dataclass.

---

## IconStyle

Icon decoration shown on the element.

### Fields

| Field   | Type  | Description                            |
|---------|-------|----------------------------------------|
| `type`  | `str` | `"emoji"` or `"image"`                 |
| `value` | `str` | Emoji character or image path/URL      |

### Interface

```
IconStyle
  + type: str
  + value: str
```

### Notes

- Frozen dataclass.
- No URL validation; `backending` or `frontending` resolves image paths.

---

## Layout

Container for the three optional style sub-objects. May carry an `id` when
defined as a named layout in the YAML configuration.

### Fields

| Field        | Type                      | Description                              |
|--------------|---------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| `id`         | `str \| None`             | Set when the layout is named; `None` for inline anonymous layouts |
| `background` | `BackgroundStyle \| None` | Background fill style                    |
| `border`     | `BorderStyle \| None`     | Border style                             |
| `icon`       | `IconStyle \| None`       | Icon decoration style                    |

### Interface

```
Layout
  + id: str | None
  + background: BackgroundStyle | None
  + border: BorderStyle | None
  + icon: IconStyle | None
```

### Notes

- Frozen dataclass.
- All sub-objects are optional; an empty `Layout` (all `None`) is valid as a
  placeholder.
- Reference resolution (`str` → `Layout`) is done by `backending`, not here.
